// Copy to Config/Shared.xcconfig and set it as the base configuration of the SampleTV target
// (Project > Info > Configurations) for both Debug and Release.

// The leading "?" makes the include optional, so a fresh clone and CI still build without secrets.
// Secrets.xcconfig defines TMDB_READ_ACCESS_TOKEN, which Info.plist reads through
// the key TMDBReadAccessToken = $(TMDB_READ_ACCESS_TOKEN). If the file is missing the
// value is empty and the app must show a "missing token" message instead of crashing.
#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
